  "properties": {
    "title": "QField 4 & QFieldCloud - your fieldwork companions",
    "description": "QField brings the power of QGIS to the field, enabling efficient data collection based on QGIS projects, both offline and online. The release of QField 4, new features further improve performance, usability, and flexibility of the application.\r\n\r\nTogether with QFieldCloud, which enables seamless synchronization and collaboration between field and office, the ecosystem has introduced new exciting functionalities.\r\n\r\nIn this talk, we will explore what\u2019s new in QField 4 and QFieldCloud, and show how they work together to create a smooth, end-to-end field data workflow.",
